cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "nemeton: Systemic Forest Analysis Using the Nemeton Method"
abstract: >
  Implement the Nemeton method for systemic forest territory analysis.
  Calculate multi-family biophysical indicators across 12 ecosystem
  service families (carbon, water, soil, landscape, biodiversity,
  temporal, risk, social, production, energy, naturalness, air),
  perform temporal analysis, normalize to composite indices, and
  visualize results. Designed for foresters, ecologists, and land
  managers.
